OL,3,AFiona the hippo dies after swallowing a
OL,4,Ahat at Cincinnati Zoo
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe vet staff "tried everything they
OL,7,Fcould to help her" but "despite
OL,8,Fmultiple attempts to move the hat out
OL,9,Fof her system, it was ultimately too
OL,10,Fmuch to overcome", the zoo said.
